Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

something like this,

x = c(1:10)
y = c(1:100)

z = (x%o%y) # a matrix

d = with(melt(z), data.frame(x=x[X1],y=y[X2],z=value))

ggplot(d, aes(x, y, z = z)) + stat_contour()

HTH,

baptiste

